    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearing strange noises? Seeing unsettling shadows? Call the Un-Usual Hotline\u2014our operators are ready to guide you through the unseen dangers lurking in your daily life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Un-Usual Hotline</i> is an analog horror-inspired telephone operator simulator where you field calls from concerned callers, helping them identify entities and send helpful information. Dive into an extensive catalogue of  information and strive to become a trusted expert in usual protection. Your advice could be the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Gonnerme comes a chilling new horror experience wrapped in retro 90\u2019s tech aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a comprehensive database of common  threats using vintage  technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical decisions based on your deductions\u2014get it wrong, and your callers might pay the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the rich lore of Un-Usual Hotline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the operator\u2019s chair\u2014can you keep your callers safe?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearing strange noises? Seeing unsettling shadows? Call the Un-Usual Hotline\u2014our operators are ready to guide you through the unseen dangers lurking in your daily life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Un-Usual Hotline</i> is an analog horror-inspired telephone operator simulator where you field calls from concerned callers, helping them identify entities and send helpful information. Dive into an extensive catalogue of  information and strive to become a trusted expert in usual protection. Your advice could be the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Gonnerme comes a chilling new horror experience wrapped in retro 90\u2019s tech aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a comprehensive database of common  threats using vintage  technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make critical decisions based on your deductions\u2014get it wrong, and your callers might pay the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the rich lore of Un-Usual Hotline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the operator\u2019s chair\u2014can you keep your callers safe?</strong></p>",
